OL,3,GNEWSAPublic touched by artist's
OL,4,Aportrait of dying father
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist who began painting a portrait
OL,7,Fof his father just before his death
OL,8,Fsaid finishing it had been "part of the
OL,9,Fgrieving process".
OL,11,FVincent Michael Brown, from Warmley,
OL,12,Fnear Bristol, painted his dad "all
OL,13,Fthrough" his life and even had one of
OL,14,Fhis portraits shortlisted for the BP
OL,15,FPortrait Award.
OL,17,FBut when he shared Father Holding On,
OL,18,Fhis final painting of his dad, online,
OL,19,Fhe was "completely shocked by the
OL,20,Fresponse".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
