OL,3,GNEWSAPublic touched by artist's
OL,4,Aportrait of dying father
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Painting my father dying is about as
OL,7,Femotional as it gets. I did most of it
OL,8,Fin tears, but it helped me. So many
OL,9,Fpeople wrote to me saying they saw
OL,10,Ftheir experience in my painting," he
OL,11,Fsaid.
